## Before you apply

1. **AMIs resolve automatically.** `images.tf` looks up the latest matching AMI per
   detected OS via `aws_ami` data sources — no IDs to fill in. To pin a specific/golden
   image, set `ami_overrides` in `terraform.tfvars`.
2. **Review sizing.** Instance types were selected to fit each source VM's vCPU and
   memory with headroom. Adjust in `compute.tf` if needed.
3. **Review networking.** A VPC (`{{ network.vpc_cidr }}`) with public/private subnets
   across {{ network.subnets | selectattr("tier", "equalto", SubnetTier.PUBLIC) | list | length }}
   AZs, security groups, and {{ "a NAT gateway" if network.nat_gateway else "no NAT gateway" }} is defined.

## Deploy

```bash
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply
```

